      "describe_ch": "能夠瞭解與分析各種非營利組織的組織運作架構與模式。",
      "describe_en": "Understanding and analyzing the organization scheme of nonprofit organizations."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "能夠瞭解、分析與應用各種非營利組織經營管理模式與要素。",
      "describe_en": "Analysis and application of basic model and elements of nonprofit management."
    }
